=== ISSUE ===
Title: get_next_puzzle / get_puzzle_batch accept any difficulty string; invalid values are silently ignored

The Lichess API spec (https://github.com/lichess-org/api/blob/906d1a6e93ca1ba4b65c9decb3077f2431c6d55a/doc/specs/lichess-api.yaml) limits `difficulty` to easiest, easier, normal, harder, hardest; `play_puzzle` already enforces these. `get_next_puzzle` and `get_puzzle_batch` take any string, and their tests used "hard" and "medium". Lichess returns 200 for invalid values, so the setting is silently ignored.

